  notes: "M14D projectile-pair intercept fixture. Pool seeds two intercept pairs per the spec's Gherkin-1 (frag grenade + rifle bullet) and Gherkin-4 (C-RAM APS laser + HEAT round). The per-tick `cf_physics::run_projectile_pair_pass` (wired in cf-control between actor-collision + terrain passes) resolves each pair within the first 1-2 ticks and emits `collision.projectile_pair_contact` with cosmetic=true.",
  scripted_steps: [],
